{"speciesId":262,"names":{"fr":"Grahyèna","es":"Mightyena","en":"Mightyena","ja":"グラエナ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"MIGHTYENA gives obvious signals when it is preparing to attack. It starts to growl deeply and then flattens its body. This POKéMON will bite savagely with its sharply pointed fangs."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"MIGHTYENA travel and act as a pack in the wild. The memory of its life in the wild compels the POKéMON to obey only those TRAINERS that it recognizes to possess superior skill."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"In the wild, MIGHTYENA live in a pack. They never defy their leader’s orders. They defeat foes with perfectly coordinated teamwork."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It will always obey the commands of a skilled TRAINER. Its behavior arises from its living in packs in ancient times."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It will always obey the commands of a skilled TRAINER. Its behavior arises from its living in packs in ancient times."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It chases down prey in a pack. It will never disobey the commands of a skilled Trainer."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It chases down prey in a pack. It will never disobey the commands of a skilled Trainer."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It chases down prey in a pack. It will never disobey the commands of a skilled Trainer."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It chases down prey in a pack of around ten. They defeat foes with perfectly coordinated teamwork."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It chases down prey in a pack of around ten. They defeat foes with perfectly coordinated teamwork."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il traque ses proies en groupe. Il ne désobéira jamais aux ordres d’un bon Dresseur."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It chases down prey in a pack. It will never disobey the commands of a skilled Trainer."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il traque ses proies en groupe. Il ne désobéira jamais aux ordres d’un bon Dresseur."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It chases down prey in a pack. It will never disobey the commands of a skilled Trainer."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It chases down prey in a pack. It will never disobey the commands of a skilled Trainer."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It chases down prey in a pack. It will never disobey the commands of a skilled Trainer."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il obéit toujours aux ordres de son Dresseur si celui-ci est très doué. Son comportement vient de l’époque reculée où il vivait en meute."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Siempre obedece a los buenos Entrenadores. Está acostumbrado a vivir en jaurías en estado salvaje."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It will always obey the commands of a skilled Trainer. Its behavior arises from its living in packs in ancient times."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"優れた トレーナーの 命令には 絶対に 服従。大昔に 群れで 行動していた 名残り。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Les Grahyèna forment des meutes de dix qui excellent au travail de groupe pour capturer leurs proies."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Forman manadas de diez individuos y cercan a sus presas valiéndose de un trabajo en equipo impecable."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It chases down prey in a pack of around ten. They defeat foes with perfectly coordinated teamwork."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"１０匹 程度の 群れを 作って 一糸乱れぬ チームワークで 獲物を 追いつめて しとめるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"On peut facilement deviner quand Grahyèna se prépare à attaquer. Il grogne et se met à plat ventre. Ce Pokémon mord sauvagement ses ennemis avec ses crocs acérés."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Es muy fácil prever cuándo va a atacar Mightyena; se pone a gruñir con fuerza y se estira. Este Pokémon da unos mordiscos tremendos con los afilados colmillos que tiene."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Mightyena gives obvious signals when it is preparing to attack. It starts to growl deeply and then flattens its body. This Pokémon will bite savagely with its sharply pointed fangs."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"どう猛な うなり声を あげながら 姿勢を 低く している ときは 攻撃の 前触れ。 鋭く とがった キバで がぶりと かみつく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Les Grahyèna vivent et se déplacent en meute. Leurs réminiscences de la vie sauvage les poussent à n’obéir qu’aux Dresseurs qu’ils considèrent comme réellement talentueux."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Mightyena se desplaza y vive con su jauría en estado salvaje. Por eso, acostumbrado a esta libertad, obedece al Entrenador al que considere realmente dotado de habilidades superiores al resto."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Mightyena travel and act as a pack in the wild. The memory of its life in the wild compels the Pokémon to obey only those Trainers that it recognizes to possess superior skill."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"グループで 行動していた 野生の 血が 残っているので 優れた トレーナー だけを リーダーと 認めて 命令に 従う。"}],"varieties":[{"id":262,"moves":[{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",9],[6,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",9],[7,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",9],[8,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",9],[9,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",9],[10,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",9],[11,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",9],[12,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",9],[13,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",9],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",9],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",9],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",7],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",7],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",7],[23,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",7],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0],[23,"level-up",32]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,